I am in the mobile shop.
The shopkeeper has a tablet.
He fills out my form on the tablet.
He asks me, "Madam, where are you from?"
I tell him, "I am from Mexico."
He enters this information into the tablet.
Then he asks me, "What is your age?"
I reply, "I am thirty-one years old."
He writes thirty-one on the tablet.
Then he asks, "Madam, do you have an ID?"
I say, "Yes, I have my ID."
I take the ID out of the bag.
I give him that ID.
He looks at the ID.
The shopkeeper completes my form.
Now my registration is complete.
